Subject: [PATCH 22/25] phy: Use PTR_ERR_OR_ZERO to fix warning raised by coccinelle
Date: Thu, 27 Nov 2014 11:56:14 +0530
Message-ID: <1417069577-1169-23-git-send-email-kishon@ti.com>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 1.7.9.5
In-Reply-To: <1417069577-1169-1-git-send-email-kishon@ti.com>
References: <1417069577-1169-1-git-send-email-kishon@ti.com>
MIME-Version: 1.0
